[ti:Pioneer Pilots]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:00.25]Lesson 20 | 第20课
[00:02.10]Pioneer pilots | 飞行员的先驱
[00:09.15]What was the name of the first plane to fly across the English Channel? | 第一架飞越英吉利海峡的飞机叫什么名字？
[00:15.81]In 1908 Lord Northcliffe offered a prize of ￡1, 000 to the first man who would fly across the English Channel. | 1908年，诺思克利夫勋爵悬赏1000英镑，奖励第一个飞越英吉利海峡的人。
[00:26.78]Over a year passed before the first attempt was made. | 一年多之后才有人试图飞越海峡。
[00:31.28]On July 19th, 1909, in the early morning, | 1909年7月19日凌晨，
[00:36.36]Hubert Latham took off from the French coast in his plane the 'Antoinette IV.' | 休伯特·莱瑟姆驾驶“安特瓦奈特4号”飞机从法国海岸起飞。
[00:43.14]He had travelled only seven miles across the Channel when his engine failed and he was forced to land on the sea. | 他仅仅飞行了7英里，引擎就发生了故障，他被迫降落在海面上。
[00:52.26]The 'Antoinette' floated on the water until Latham was picked up by a ship. | “安特瓦奈特号”飞机在海上漂浮，直到莱瑟姆被一艘船救起。
[00:59.22]Two days later, Louis Bleriot arrived near Calais with a plane called 'No.XI'. | 两天之后，路易·布莱里奥驾驶一架名为“11号”的飞机来到加莱附近。
[01:07.16]Bleriot had been making planes since 1905 and this was his latest model. | 布莱里奥从1905年起便开始制造飞机，这是他制造的最新型号。
[01:14.33]A week before, he had completed a successful overland flight during which he covered twenty-six miles. | 一周以前，他曾成功地进行了一次26英里的陆上飞行。
[01:22.54]Latham, however, did not give up easily. | 但是莱瑟姆不肯轻易罢休。
[01:25.76]He, too, arrived near Calais on the same day with a new 'Antoinette'. | 同一天，他也驾驶一架新的“安特瓦奈特号”来到加莱附近。
[01:32.20]It looked as if there would be an exciting race across the Channel. | 看来将有一场飞越海峡的激动人心的比赛。
[01:37.19]Both planes were going to take off on July 25th, but Latham failed to get up early enough. | 两架飞机都定于7月25日起飞，但莱瑟姆那天起得太晚，没能赶上。
[01:45.05]After making a short test flight at 4.15 a.m., Bleriot set off half an hour later. | 布莱里奥凌晨4点15分作了一次短距离试飞之后，半小时后便出发了。
[01:53.10]His great flight lasted thirty-seven minutes. | 他这次伟大的飞行持续了37分钟。
[01:56.90]When he landed near Dover, the first person to greet him was a local policeman. | 他在多佛附近着陆时，第一个迎接他的是当地一名警察。
[02:03.67]Latham made another attempt a week later and got within half a mile of Dover, | 莱瑟姆一周以后又作了一次尝试，飞到了离多佛不到半英里的地方。
[02:09.34]but he was unlucky again. | 但这次他又不走运。
[02:11.85]His engine failed and he landed on the sea for the second time. | 引擎出了故障，他第二次降落在海面上。
